│  # Madrid, Spain: 3-Day Travel Itinerary (Feb 14–16, 2026)                                                    │
│                                                                                                               │
│  ## 🌞 Weather Forecast                                                                                       │
│  **Daytime**: 14°C (57°F) | **Nighttime**: 7°C (45°F)                                                         │
│  **Conditions**: Sunny with light rain possible; pack layers, waterproofs, and comfortable shoes.             │
│                                                                                                               │
│  ---                                                                                                          │
│                                                                                                               │
│  ## 🗓️ Day 1: Royal Palace & Plaza Mayor                                                                       │
│  **Morning**:                                                                                                 │
│  - **Royal Palace of Madrid** (10:00–13:00)                                                                   │
│    - Explore Spain’s royal history, opulent halls, and the **Museo del Prado** (book tickets in advance).     │
│    - **Entrance Fee**: €15.                                                                                   │
│                                                                                                               │
│  **Afternoon**:                                                                                               │
│  - **Plaza Mayor** (15:00–17:00)                                                                              │
│    - Stroll through the historic square, admire baroque architecture, and enjoy street performances.          │
│                                                                                                               │
│  **Evening**:                                                                                                 │
│  - **La Latina** (19:00–21:00)                                                                                │
│    - Dine at **Café Gijón** for traditional *churros con chocolate* or *tortilla española*.                   │
│    - **Dinner Budget**: €15–€20.                                                                              │
│                                                                                                               │
│  **Accommodation**:                                                                                           │
│  - **Hotel Ritz-Carlton** (luxury: €350/night) or **Ibis Budget** (budget: €120/night).                       │
│                                                                                                               │
│  **Packing Tip**:                                                                                             │
│  - Layer sweaters, waterproof jacket, and comfortable walking shoes.                                          │
│                                                                                                               │
│  ---                                                                                                          │
│                                                                                                               │
│  ## 🗓️ Day 2: Madrid Art Fair & Mercado de San Miguel                                                          │
│  **Morning**:                                                                                                 │
│  - **Madrid Art Fair** (10:00–12:00)                                                                          │
│    - Visit galleries showcasing contemporary art (e.g., **Casa de Velázquez**).                               │
│    - **Admission**: Free (limited to 3 days, check exact dates).                                              │
│                                                                                                               │
│  **Afternoon**:                                                                                               │
│  - **Mercado de San Miguel** (14:00–17:00)                                                                    │
│    - Explore this iconic food market for tapas like *patatas bravas* and *croquetas*.                         │
│    - **Lunch Budget**: €10–€15.                                                                               │
│                                                                                                               │
│  **Evening**:                                                                                                 │
│  - **Retiro Park** (18:00–20:00)                                                                              │
│    - Relax by the lake, stroll through the **Palacio de Velázquez**, or enjoy a sunset picnic.                │
│                                                                                                               │
│  **Packing Tip**:                                                                                             │
│  - Carry a compact umbrella and a reusable water bottle.                                                      │
│                                                                                                               │
│  ---                                                                                                          │
│                                                                                                               │
│  ## 🗓️ Day 3: Sorolla Museum & Farewell Tapas                                                                  │
│  **Morning**:                                                                                                 │
│  - **Sorolla Museum** (10:00–12:00)                                                                           │
│    - Admire the works of Joaquín Sorolla, a Spanish Impressionist.                                            │
│    - **Entrance Fee**: €12.                                                                                   │
│                                                                                                               │
│  **Afternoon**:                                                                                               │
│  - **Parque del Oeste** (14:00–16:00)                                                                         │
│    - Visit this urban park with a view of the **Manzana de la Discordia** (a historic site).                  │
│                                                                                                               │
│  **Evening**:                                                                                                 │
│  - **Farewell Tapas** (19:00–21:00)                                                                           │
│    - Dine at **Cervecería Catalana** for *paella* or *gazpacho*.                                              │
│    - **Dinner Budget**: €25–€35.                                                                              │
│                                                                                                               │
│  **Packing Tip**:                                                                                             │
│  - Bring a light scarf for cooler evenings.                                                                   │
│                                                                                                               │
│  ---                                                                                                          │
│                                                                                                               │
