│  - **Hotel Ritz-Carlton** (luxury, €350/night)                                                                │
│  - **Ibis Budget** (budget, €120/night)                                                                       │
│  - **Parador de Madrid** (historic, €300/night)                                                               │
│                                                                                                               │
